```

Putting it all together:

```csharp
public decimal CalculateTotalCost(decimal carPrice, decimal clothesPrice, decimal bookPrice)
{
    decimal totalClothesAndBooksPrice = clothesPrice + bookPrice;
    if (carPrice < 2 * totalClothesAndBooksPrice)
    {
        carPrice = 2 * totalClothesAndBooksPrice;
    }
    return carPrice + clothesPrice + bookPrice;
}
```

